  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-11T21:48:27.646069Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T07:20:00.369161Z",
  "totalBlocks": 83,
  "translatedBlocks": 82,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3f59bcf5a7250fb",
      "translationZh": "新内容！（May 23, '25）如果你更喜欢 Python，可以看看配套文章《用 Python 构建 Tiny Agents》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "194573792e884f43",
      "translationZh": "过去几周，我一直在深入研究 MCP（Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议），想弄清楚围绕它的热议究竟是怎么回事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b0ee3a2d34dc744",
      "translationZh": "我的简短结论是：它相当简单，却依然非常强大。MCP 是一种标准 API，用于对外提供一组可接入 LLMs 的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfdad3b5b8abe531",
      "translationZh": "扩展一个推理客户端，让它同时充当 MCP 客户端，并将 MCP 服务器提供的可用工具接入 LLM 推理，其实相当简单。在 HF，我们有两个官方客户端 SDK：JS 中的 @huggingface/inference，以及 Python 中的 huggingface_hub。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5276a5a713b9877c",
      "translationZh": "但在这个过程中，我又有了第二个发现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63fceca363e0f13f",
      "translationZh": "一旦有了 MCP 客户端，智能体实际上就只是在它之上加一个 while 循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "106b915e171d417f",
      "translationZh": "在这篇短文中，我会带你了解我是如何用 Typescript（JS）实现它的、你也可以如何采用 MCP，以及它将如何让今后的智能体 AI 变得简单得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa1133b9e0ab0a7f",
      "translationZh": "图片来源 https://x.com/adamdotdev",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "acfcaff1151ff3e4",
      "translationZh": "如何运行完整演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96d841cf8e49a38e",
      "translationZh": "如果你已安装 NodeJS（以及 pnpm 或 npm），只需在终端中运行以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49f1fffb2a0c9edb",
      "translationZh": "如果使用 pnpm，则运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fbd354cf79d3b02",
      "translationZh": "这会将我的软件包安装到一个临时文件夹中，然后执行它的命令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cc62f1800dfb452",
      "translationZh": "你会看到这个简单的智能体连接到两个不同的 MCP 服务器（在本地运行），加载它们的工具，然后提示你开始对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1074557a1525437",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，我们的示例智能体会连接到以下两个 MCP 服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a97f6e91f8386aed",
      "translationZh": "“标准”的文件系统服务器，它可以访问你的桌面；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6526e858948f4d4",
      "translationZh": "以及 Playwright MCP 服务器，它知道如何为你操作一个在沙箱中运行的 Chromium 浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f09194cf0b1243e6",
      "translationZh": "注意：这有点违背直觉，但目前所有 MCP 服务器实际上都是本地进程（不过，远程服务器很快就会推出）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5af00d321a4342c",
      "translationZh": "我们在第一个视频中的输入是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7de730698a6e7824",
      "translationZh": "写一首关于 Hugging Face 社区的俳句，并将其写入我桌面上名为 \"hf.txt\" 的文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cf7b0657bade54b",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们试试这个涉及网页浏览的提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60f43d925308dc7c",
      "translationZh": "在 Brave Search 上进行网页搜索，查找 HF 推理服务提供商，并打开前 3 个结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2c85a7e4987e059e",
      "translationZh": "默认模型与提供商",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe14343c27b444c9",
      "translationZh": "在模型与提供商的组合方面，我们的示例智能体默认使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb46772c3a458926",
      "translationZh": "在 Nebius 上运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef97d653bb24785c",
      "translationZh": "这些都可以通过环境变量配置！请参阅：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "16220ca90e832f8b",
      "translationZh": "代码在哪里",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7e9df61ca3c7c0",
      "translationZh": "Tiny Agent 的代码位于 huggingface.js 单体仓库的 mcp-client 子包中，这是存放我们所有 JS 库的 GitHub 单体仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55abc1239b1fc3ad",
      "translationZh": "这套代码使用了现代 JS 特性（尤其是异步生成器），让实现变得容易得多，特别是在处理 LLM 响应这类异步事件时。如果你还不熟悉这些 JS 特性，可能需要向 LLM 请教一下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "025236f541f026d9",
      "translationZh": "这一切的基础：LLM 对工具调用的原生支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "834afa009d9bc0c2",
      "translationZh": "让整篇博文所介绍的内容变得非常容易实现的是，最近这一批 LLM（无论封闭还是开放）都接受过函数调用（也称工具使用）方面的训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bff95503ffa132ec",
      "translationZh": "工具由其名称、描述以及参数的 JSONSchema 表示来定义。从某种意义上说，它是从外部看到的任意函数接口的不透明表示（也就是说，LLM 并不关心函数实际上是如何实现的）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ec4e57a872df3f3",
      "translationZh": "我在这里要链接的权威文档是 OpenAI 的函数调用文档。（是的……OpenAI 几乎为整个社区定义了 LLM 标准 😅）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3ae581986728183",
      "translationZh": "推理引擎允许你在调用 LLM 时传入一个工具列表，LLM 可以自由选择不调用任何工具，或调用其中一个或多个工具。作为开发者，你需要运行这些工具，并将它们的结果反馈给 LLM，以继续生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1ee43a0162da26f",
      "translationZh": "请注意，在后端（推理引擎层面），工具和其他消息一样，只是通过经过特殊格式化的 chat_template 传递给模型，然后从响应中解析出来（使用模型专属的特殊 token），以工具调用的形式呈现。你可以在我们的 chat-template 试验场中查看一个示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68de4d336fa8d5b0",
      "translationZh": "基于 InferenceClient 实现 MCP 客户端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee9a9b683807eaa1",
      "translationZh": "既然我们已经了解了近期 LLM 中的工具是什么，接下来就来实现真正的 MCP 客户端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "326acb0030746a38",
      "translationZh": "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/quickstart/client 上的官方文档写得相当不错。你只需要将所有提到 Anthropic 客户端 SDK 的地方替换为任何其他兼容 OpenAI 的客户端 SDK。（另外还有一个 llms.txt，你可以将它提供给你选择的 LLM，帮助你跟着编写代码）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640aa58a0acea97b",
      "translationZh": "提醒一下，我们使用 HF 的 InferenceClient 作为推理客户端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6913d69cc28f4a0f",
      "translationZh": "完整的 McpClient.ts 代码文件就在这里，如果你想对照实际代码跟着操作，可以查看它 🤓",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5578f186a378db2",
      "translationZh": "我们的 McpClient 类包含：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26165562579d74aa",
      "translationZh": "一个推理客户端（可与任何推理提供商配合使用，而且 huggingface/inference 同时支持远程和本地端点）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12e3c1ce0cb8c32f",
      "translationZh": "一组 MCP 客户端会话，每个已连接的 MCP 服务器对应一个会话（没错，我们希望支持多个服务器）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1aa7cedb4ac2e402",
      "translationZh": "以及一个可用工具列表，该列表将从已连接的服务器中填充，并仅对格式稍作调整。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "740bca2e041c8673",
      "translationZh": "要连接到 MCP 服务器，官方的 @modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client TypeScript SDK 提供了一个 Client 类，其中包含 listTools() 方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "346909921d7d1f3d",
      "translationZh": "StdioServerParameters 是 MCP SDK 中的一个接口，可让你轻松启动本地进程：正如我们之前提到的，目前所有 MCP 服务器实际上都是本地进程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e62e5913b144ceda",
      "translationZh": "对于我们连接的每个 MCP 服务器，我们都会稍微调整其工具列表的格式，并将这些工具添加到 this.availableTools 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f5bbf6d438d40998",
      "translationZh": "如何使用这些工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a538fcfc2b842a25",
      "translationZh": "很简单，除了通常的消息数组之外，你只需将 this.availableTools 传给 LLM 的聊天补全接口：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "980d307b7218d904",
      "translationZh": "tool_choice: \"auto\" 是你传入的参数，用于让 LLM 生成零个、一个或多个工具调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50ae565143924e49",
      "translationZh": "在解析输出或以流式方式接收输出时，LLM 会生成一些工具调用（即函数名和一些 JSON 编码的参数），这些调用需要由你（作为开发者）来执行。MCP 客户端 SDK 再次让这件事变得非常简单；它提供了一个 client.callTool() 方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d81ab6a4518ebd3",
      "translationZh": "最后，你会将生成的工具消息添加到消息数组中，再将其传回 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7f9366ca6d30c72b",
      "translationZh": "我们的 50 行代码智能体 🤯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb18a50572501bc",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们有了一个 MCP 客户端，它能够连接到任意 MCP 服务器以获取工具列表，也能将这些工具注入 LLM 推理过程，并从中解析工具调用，那么……什么是智能体呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27ba1ecf3505e393",
      "translationZh": "一旦你有了一个配备一组工具的推理客户端，智能体就只是在它之上加一个 while 循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11a221b6652a2b6f",
      "translationZh": "更具体地说，智能体只是以下各项的组合：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55a9a503848244c6",
      "translationZh": "一个系统提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "674ea0cca30b3ff1",
      "translationZh": "一个 LLM 推理客户端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4d30d39fc45c567",
      "translationZh": "一个 MCP 客户端，用于将来自多个 MCP 服务器的一组工具接入其中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72f915812cb68d31",
      "translationZh": "一些基本的控制流（while 循环见下文）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b02c22b9c737fab",
      "translationZh": "完整的 Agent.ts 代码文件在这里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddce1362ba759a5c",
      "translationZh": "我们的 Agent 类只是继承了 McpClient：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59b4cfc1e4fc5d43",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，我们使用一个非常简单的系统提示词，其灵感来自 GPT-4.1 提示词指南中分享的那个提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58f5cee35dedad9c",
      "translationZh": "尽管这来自 OpenAI 😈，但尤其是下面这句话，适用于越来越多的模型，无论是闭源还是开放模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb82230db5312642",
      "translationZh": "我们鼓励开发者仅使用 tools 字段来传入工具，而不是手动将工具描述注入提示词，再为工具调用编写单独的解析器——此前有些开发者表示自己采用过这种做法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65ac13ffa53bbac1",
      "translationZh": "也就是说，我们不需要在提示词中提供精心排版的工具使用示例列表。tools: this.availableTools 参数就足够了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b28b1dc8ca5e567e",
      "translationZh": "给 Agent 加载工具，实际上就是连接到我们想要的 MCP 服务器（并行连接，因为在 JS 中这样做非常容易）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27b5d9a2be3d6992",
      "translationZh": "我们添加了两个额外的工具（不属于 MCP），供 LLM 用于控制我们 Agent 的执行流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16dec922b55e13d5",
      "translationZh": "调用其中任何一个工具时，Agent 都会跳出循环，将控制权交还给用户，以接收新的输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "41ce87cee8d8ebb9",
      "translationZh": "完整的 while 循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4b6b66fbe745bc1",
      "translationZh": "来看看我们完整的 while 循环吧。🎉",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5c3e0ce8c2e03c4",
      "translationZh": "我们 Agent 的主 while 循环的核心思路是：我们只需不断与 LLM 交互，交替执行工具调用和向它提供工具结果，直到 LLM 开始连续回复两条非工具消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "960eeb021f1a0afa",
      "translationZh": "这是完整的 while 循环：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dd00d3d3e9f73d27",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9c4f5eecea4d655",
      "translationZh": "一旦你有了一个运行中的 MCP 客户端，以及一种构建智能体的简单方法，就可以尝试许多很酷的后续探索方向 🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12a1f810620e350c",
      "translationZh": "尝试其他模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5728af047b7aaf3a",
      "translationZh": "mistralai/Mistral-Small-3.1-24B-Instruct-2503 针对函数调用进行了优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1edd40121952099",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 3 27B、Gemma 3 QAT 模型是函数调用的热门选择，不过，由于它不使用原生工具，我们需要实现工具解析（欢迎提交 PR！）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "101d94654aa1c9ea",
      "translationZh": "尝试所有推理服务提供商：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "264b0c732f038ee3",
      "translationZh": "Cerebras、Cohere、Fal、Fireworks、Hyperbolic、Nebius、Novita、Replicate、SambaNova、Together 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abf1dab8e3122d0b",
      "translationZh": "它们各自针对函数调用做了不同的优化（也取决于所用模型），因此性能可能有所不同！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b12b40967410a2f3",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp 或 LM Studio 接入本地大语言模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af059888f3dea56a",
      "translationZh": "欢迎提交拉取请求和贡献！再强调一次，这里的一切都是开源的！💎❤️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
